# Frozen user-facing Display messages for ContractError (Issue #686).
#
# Format: `<code> <Variant> <message>`. Dashboards and the indexer map these
# strings to UX copy, so a reworded message is an integrator-facing change.
# `tests/contract_error_codes.rs` asserts every live code in
# `contract_error_codes.golden` appears here and that `Display` matches.
# To change a message on purpose, update src/error.rs, this file, and
# CHANGELOG.md together.

1 AlreadyInitialized contract already initialized
2 NotInitialized contract not initialized
3 NotAuthorized caller not authorized
4 NotRegistered github username not registered
5 AlreadyVerified username already verified
6 NotVerified username not verified
7 Paused contract is paused
8 CooldownActive upgrade cooldown active
9 InvalidVersion invalid version
10 InvalidRole invalid role
11 InvalidUsername invalid github username
12 AttestationExpired attestation expired
13 UnattestedWasm unattested wasm
14 InvalidBatchSize invalid batch size
15 InvalidReasonCode invalid reason code
16 ZeroAddress zero address
17 ChallengeAlreadyActive challenge already active
18 NoChallengeActive no challenge active
19 ChallengeNotResolvable challenge not resolvable
20 ChallengeActive challenge active
21 InvalidPauseReason invalid pause reason
22 AlreadyReserved username already reserved
23 NotReserved username not reserved
24 UsernameReserved username reserved
25 ReservedListFull reserved list full
26 AdminTransferPending admin transfer pending
27 AdminTransferDelayActive admin transfer delay active
28 NoPendingAdminTransfer no pending admin transfer
29 AttestationRequired attestation required
30 NetworkMismatch network mismatch
31 VerifierAllowlistFull verifier allowlist full
32 VerifierNotAllowlisted verifier not allowlisted
33 VerifierExpiryInPast verifier expiry in past
34 NoPendingRoleGrant no pending role grant
35 RoleGrantNotReady role grant not ready
36 ProvenanceMissing provenance missing
37 ProvenanceMismatch provenance mismatch
39 StagedWasmMismatch staged wasm mismatch
40 UpgradeProposalAlreadyPending upgrade proposal already pending
41 NoUpgradeProposalPending no upgrade proposal pending
42 UpgradeProposalAlreadyApproved upgrade proposal already approved
43 UpgradeProposalDelayActive upgrade proposal delay active
44 UpgradeProposalInsufficientApprovals upgrade proposal insufficient approvals
46 FallbackListFull fallback list full
47 UsernameTaken username taken
48 RotationRequired rotation required
49 RotationPending rotation pending
50 NoRotationPending no rotation pending
51 RotationNotReady rotation not ready
52 InvalidCursor invalid cursor
